{"availability":"available","full":"chinmay-sawant/gopdfsuit","name":"gopdfsuit","description":"GoPDFSuit - Ultra Fast PDF Engine (Gin Web + gopdflib +pypdfsuit)","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":607,"forks":37,"created":"2025-08-15T06:45:40Z","updated":"2026-09-08T17:03:20Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://chinmay-sawant.github.io/gopdfsuit/","topics":["digital-signatures","docker","gofpdf","golang","gopdf","html-to-pdf","json-to-pdf","pdf","pdf-compression","pdf-converter","pdf-forms","pdf-generator","pdf-generator-api","pdf-manipulation","pdfa","python","python3","react","rest-api","wasm"],"demo":"https://chinmay-sawant.github.io/gopdfsuit/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T11:01:20.757Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T11:01:20.757Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T11:01:20.757Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T09:01:27.442Z","stars":607,"forks":37},{"at":"2026-10-17T11:01:20.757Z","stars":607,"forks":37}],"technologies":["React","Python","Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["gopdfsuit (REST API), gopdflib (Go library), pypdfsuit (Python bindings). I built it to generate PDFs from JSON templates, with multi-page support, merge, form fill, and HTML to PDF or image.","I got tired of hosted PDF services that charge per page and hide the layout logic. This repo keeps the template in JSON where you can read it, and the engine runs in memory with no Ghostscript and no external calls. Compliance output is slower, and that tradeoff is real. The numbers below show both sides.","Three apps, one repo. Pick what fits your stack."],"features":["Template-based generation. You send JSON, the engine returns PDF. It handles page breaks and flow across pages.","Security and compliance. PKCS#7 and X.509 signatures, AES-256 encryption, granular permissions, PDF/A-4 and PDF/UA-2 when you opt in.","Advanced elements. Text styling, tables, barcodes, QR codes, SVG vector graphics, and interactive forms with checkboxes and radio buttons.","Navigation. Bookmarks, internal links, and named destinations the engine wires up for you.","Form filling. Fills AcroForms and XFDF data."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chinmay-sawant/gopdfsuit/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"5aa81ddd5168022483a0c1ae9c2150efc525af8993a13b6c44863cad380b1d6f","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:27.508Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:27.508Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"gopdfsuit (REST API), gopdflib (Go library), pypdfsuit (Python bindings). I built it to generate PDFs from JSON templates, with multi-page support, merge, form fill, and HTML to PDF or image.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chinmay-sawant/gopdfsuit/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"5aa81ddd5168022483a0c1ae9c2150efc525af8993a13b6c44863cad380b1d6f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chinmay-sawant/gopdfsuit/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:27.509Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-08T17:03:20Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chinmay-sawant/gopdfsuit/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:27.509Z","hash":"5aa81ddd5168022483a0c1ae9c2150efc525af8993a13b6c44863cad380b1d6f","originalBytes":14135,"storedBytes":14135,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:27.442Z","subjects":["Writing & documents"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["Writing & documents"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Writing & documents","source":"metadata","match":"pdf converter"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Templates & UI components","Privacy & security"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://chinmay-sawant.github.io/gopdfsuit/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T09:33:16.779Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T09:33:16.779Z","lastWor